WEBVTT

04:31.560 --> 04:32.430
Jiu.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.600
Hello.

04:42.630 --> 04:43.430
Hello.

04:44.000 --> 04:44.800
Hello.

05:47.920 --> 05:49.480
Hold this

05:51.040 --> 05:52.190
and tell me

05:52.480 --> 05:53.630
why you're scared.

06:14.070 --> 06:15.040
Brother Zhuo.

06:17.070 --> 06:19.000
Do you think Ying Lei will blame me?

06:19.240 --> 06:20.150
Of course not.

06:21.510 --> 06:22.920
He did it to protect you.

06:24.870 --> 06:25.870
One day,

06:27.190 --> 06:29.720
there will be someone you want to protect too.

06:34.310 --> 06:36.070
Why do you always hold my bell?

06:36.830 --> 06:38.430
Because when I hold the bell,

06:39.190 --> 06:42.190
I feel like you're right beside me.

06:42.560 --> 06:45.159
That way, no matter how scary the road ahead is,

06:45.510 --> 06:47.370
I'm brave enough to move forward.

07:03.430 --> 07:04.430
Jiu.

07:06.270 --> 07:07.360
I'm sorry.

07:08.600 --> 07:09.720
I'm sorry.

07:26.560 --> 07:27.360
Jiu.

07:32.630 --> 07:33.950
I'll take you home.

07:52.000 --> 07:53.000
Brother Zhuo,

07:53.159 --> 07:55.220
this time it's my turn to protect you.

08:36.480 --> 08:39.840
There are countless rules in this world,

08:39.840 --> 08:42.080
but none can compare to "I am willing."

08:42.669 --> 08:43.630
Jiu!

09:08.510 --> 09:09.320
Dad!

09:14.790 --> 09:15.600
Dad.

09:17.040 --> 09:19.750
Don't leave me.

09:40.710 --> 09:41.510
Dad.

09:42.630 --> 09:43.510
Dad?

09:44.150 --> 09:44.960
Dad!

09:45.360 --> 09:46.110
Wake up!

09:46.520 --> 09:47.320
Dad?

09:47.480 --> 09:48.120
Dad!

10:18.600 --> 10:19.670
Wen Xiao.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.080
Dad.

10:27.630 --> 10:28.720
Xiao.

10:38.870 --> 10:39.390
Dad.

10:39.390 --> 10:40.480
Xiao.

10:42.320 --> 10:43.510
You recognized me?

10:44.550 --> 10:45.360
Dad.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.250
It's good that you woke up.

10:50.840 --> 10:52.120
How did I wake up?

11:00.510 --> 11:02.030
It's Baize Divine Power.

11:03.550 --> 11:04.750
The power of Baize,

11:05.600 --> 11:07.060
with water as its essence,

11:07.120 --> 11:09.050
can purify all things in the world.

11:14.910 --> 11:15.510
Dad?

11:16.120 --> 11:16.510
Dad?

11:18.120 --> 11:19.200
What's wrong?

11:20.750 --> 11:22.750
Once the inner core enters the body,

11:23.480 --> 11:25.000
it can't be reversed.

11:25.440 --> 11:25.750
Dad,

11:25.750 --> 11:26.810
that won't happen.

11:28.030 --> 11:29.150
Xiao.

11:29.150 --> 11:30.680
I will definitely save you.

11:32.550 --> 11:33.870
I can't turn back.

11:36.390 --> 11:37.790
Go and save those people.

11:39.720 --> 11:41.120
Before...

11:41.910 --> 11:43.120
the demon core in their bodies

11:43.120 --> 11:44.670
takes root completely.

11:47.670 --> 11:50.000
Dad!

11:50.440 --> 11:51.240
Dad!

11:52.360 --> 11:53.910
I promised you.

11:54.120 --> 11:55.360
It seems that in this life,

11:55.360 --> 11:56.750
you'll have to keep watching over

11:56.750 --> 11:58.880
your troublesome daughter every day.

11:59.240 --> 12:00.320
Yes.

12:01.150 --> 12:02.310
In this life...

12:05.390 --> 12:06.630
I promised...

12:08.550 --> 12:09.270
Dad.

12:10.910 --> 12:13.030
I would never leave you.

12:17.960 --> 12:20.840
But now, I can't do that.

12:28.600 --> 12:29.480
Dad!

12:34.670 --> 12:35.790
From now on,

12:36.600 --> 12:37.790
someone will...

12:38.000 --> 12:38.790
continue...

12:39.240 --> 12:41.150
to watch over you...

12:43.000 --> 12:44.130
and take care of you.

12:46.030 --> 12:46.840
Dad.

12:51.150 --> 12:51.960
Dad!

12:52.240 --> 12:53.030
Dad!

12:53.670 --> 12:54.480
Dad.

12:55.000 --> 12:55.790
Dad?

13:06.390 --> 13:07.200
Dad?

13:12.200 --> 13:13.000
Dad!

13:16.550 --> 13:17.360
Dad!

14:07.320 --> 14:08.110
Son!

14:09.750 --> 14:10.390
Son!

14:52.790 --> 14:54.190
The entire city's people

14:55.240 --> 14:57.240
are turning into demonized humans.

14:58.390 --> 14:59.240
Yes.

15:00.630 --> 15:01.600
My tears

15:03.840 --> 15:04.870
can turn the demonized humans

15:04.870 --> 15:06.000
back to normal.

15:07.630 --> 15:08.080
As long as

15:08.080 --> 15:10.510
I release Baize Divine Power within me

15:11.600 --> 15:13.130
and transform it into rain,

15:14.440 --> 15:16.630
everyone will be saved.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.880
My master taught me this.

15:20.670 --> 15:22.670
This is the final sacrificial spell

15:24.510 --> 15:26.600
of the Baize Goddesses:

15:29.720 --> 15:30.720
Guili.

15:35.550 --> 15:37.150
Without Baize Divine Power,

15:37.960 --> 15:39.030
you will die.

15:42.360 --> 15:44.120
I'm already poisoned

15:45.550 --> 15:47.210
and don't have much time left.

15:51.030 --> 15:52.910
Isn't this a better way to die?

15:56.030 --> 15:57.790
I have a better way.

16:13.270 --> 16:14.930
The love token I promised you.

16:15.510 --> 16:16.910
You must keep it safe.

16:37.670 --> 16:39.360
I carved it myself.

16:41.270 --> 16:42.510
It's the only one

16:43.480 --> 16:44.540
in this vast world.

16:46.670 --> 16:47.750
If you lose it,

16:50.720 --> 16:52.550
there won't be another.

17:01.000 --> 17:01.910
Wear it,

17:03.750 --> 17:05.829
and think of it as me being with you.

17:08.760 --> 17:09.619
Zhao Yuanzhou,

17:11.109 --> 17:12.310
what are you doing?

17:24.790 --> 17:27.920
Do you know what the source of the Baize Order's power is?

17:29.240 --> 17:30.590
I heard from my master

17:31.440 --> 17:32.770
that Baize Divine Power

17:33.310 --> 17:34.510
has no source;

17:35.480 --> 17:36.830
it is a cycle.

17:40.030 --> 17:42.760
The reason Baize Divine Power is a cyclical force

17:43.790 --> 17:46.070
is because it actually comes from malicious energy.

17:46.070 --> 17:48.400
Baize Divine Power is the force of heaven and earth's cycles,

17:48.400 --> 17:49.920
protecting the Wilderness

17:49.920 --> 17:51.950
and counteracting the malicious energy.

17:51.950 --> 17:53.440
Without you,

17:53.920 --> 17:56.450
how could this malicious energy be gathered?

17:56.750 --> 17:58.070
And how could the power of Baize

17:58.070 --> 17:59.270
continue to cycle?

18:00.920 --> 18:01.720
Am I...

18:04.510 --> 18:06.970
also a part of the cycles of heaven and earth?

18:10.160 --> 18:12.290
The stronger the malicious energy is,

18:12.400 --> 18:14.660
the stronger the power of Baize becomes.

18:16.960 --> 18:17.750
No.

18:19.350 --> 18:20.160
No!

18:24.920 --> 18:28.350
In the realm of illusions of the Bingyi Clan's forbidden area,

18:28.350 --> 18:30.240
the future Ying Long foresaw

18:31.070 --> 18:34.000
is that I ultimately die under the Cloud Light Sword,

18:37.350 --> 18:38.440
using my body

18:38.640 --> 18:41.900
to trigger the power of the Baize Order to cycle once again.

18:43.200 --> 18:45.590
This is the most powerful force in this world.

18:45.590 --> 18:46.270
No.

18:49.310 --> 18:51.570
This is what the Baize Goddess should do,

18:53.030 --> 18:54.110
not you.

19:05.350 --> 19:06.350
I told you

19:08.000 --> 19:09.720
I would make sure you live.

19:23.070 --> 19:23.790
Tie.

19:35.480 --> 19:36.340
Zhao Yuanzhou,

19:36.680 --> 19:37.940
I forbid you to do this!

19:38.160 --> 19:39.020
Zhao Yuanzhou!

19:43.400 --> 19:44.260
Zhao Yuanzhou.

19:44.310 --> 19:45.110
Zhao Yuanzhou!

19:45.110 --> 19:45.970
Zhao Yuanzhou!

19:50.830 --> 19:51.790
Let go of me.

19:52.240 --> 19:53.110
Zhao Yuanzhou,

19:53.480 --> 19:54.680
what are you doing?

19:54.680 --> 19:56.070
Let go of me!

19:56.880 --> 19:57.830
Let go of me!

19:58.200 --> 19:59.030
Let go of me!

20:10.440 --> 20:11.720
Zhao Yuanzhou!

20:15.510 --> 20:16.640
Zhao Yuanzhou!

20:24.000 --> 20:24.960
Zhao Yuanzhou,

20:24.960 --> 20:26.110
let go of me!

20:30.200 --> 20:31.480
Zhao Yuanzhou!

22:13.480 --> 22:14.350
Don't cry.

22:16.230 --> 22:17.630
Pull yourself together.

22:18.550 --> 22:20.720
You have more important things to do.

22:25.790 --> 22:27.240
Do you know why

22:28.310 --> 22:30.510
my One-Word Spell "Yi" worked on you

22:31.510 --> 22:33.680
but didn't work when breaking

22:35.110 --> 22:36.710
Wen Zongyu's barrier later?

22:37.070 --> 22:37.880
Why?

22:40.640 --> 22:42.640
Because I only gave you the ability

22:43.680 --> 22:45.540
to be immune to my One-Word Spell.

22:46.640 --> 22:49.700
At that time, you had Li Lun's demonic power inside you.

22:50.400 --> 22:52.860
The One-Word Spell recognized you as Li Lun,

22:53.920 --> 22:55.270
so it took effect.

22:57.400 --> 22:59.000
When you gave me both Li Lun's

23:00.400 --> 23:02.720
and your demonic power,

23:04.590 --> 23:07.190
my spell recognized that you were Zhuo Yichen.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.240
See?

23:11.400 --> 23:13.200
Li Lun always wanted to kill you,

23:15.240 --> 23:17.510
but in the end, by accident, he saved you.

23:19.200 --> 23:20.640
The world

23:22.440 --> 23:23.840
is full of tangled karma,

23:26.110 --> 23:28.770
always leaving people unsure of how to respond.

23:29.440 --> 23:31.000
Jiu's life

23:31.750 --> 23:34.110
was bought with Ying Lei's death.

23:34.920 --> 23:36.070
And your life

23:38.240 --> 23:40.720
was bought with Li Lun's and Jiu's deaths.

23:41.590 --> 23:42.510
Now,

23:44.080 --> 23:45.940
the lives of everyone in the world

23:46.150 --> 23:48.070
must be bought with my death.

23:51.590 --> 23:52.680
And my death

23:56.030 --> 23:58.240
must be bought with you bearing

23:59.550 --> 24:02.680
the same guilt and pain as Bingyi in the rest of your life.

24:15.110 --> 24:16.400
It's time to fulfill

24:18.640 --> 24:21.550
the vow you made when we first met.

24:23.510 --> 24:24.550
I, Zhuo Yichen,

24:25.880 --> 24:27.200
swear to the heavens.

24:27.830 --> 24:28.960
As long as Zhu Yan

24:29.310 --> 24:32.170
teaches me the true way to use the Cloud Light Sword,

24:33.200 --> 24:35.720
I will surely slay him with my sword.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.020
Zhao Yuanzhou,

25:45.960 --> 25:47.490
do we have any other choice?

25:50.550 --> 25:51.920
Did Bingyi and Ying Long

25:54.830 --> 25:56.830
have any other choice?

26:03.110 --> 26:03.960
Ying Long,

26:04.110 --> 26:05.570
to save all living beings,

26:07.000 --> 26:08.200
turned into a star.

26:10.350 --> 26:11.640
But some people in later generations

26:11.640 --> 26:13.550
call him a demon.

26:15.310 --> 26:17.240
Bingyi, as a dragon slayer,

26:18.640 --> 26:20.070
was worshipped as a god

26:22.030 --> 26:23.790
but chose to live as a mortal

26:24.960 --> 26:26.200
in seclusion.

26:28.960 --> 26:29.960
How absurd

26:33.510 --> 26:34.790
is this world?

26:38.310 --> 26:40.440
Do you remember our agreement?

26:46.590 --> 26:47.400
Yes, I do.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.550
Mr. Zhuo,

26:52.960 --> 26:53.830
this time,

26:55.510 --> 26:57.570
please make sure not to miss the mark.

27:11.270 --> 27:12.400
Mr. Zhuo,

27:14.680 --> 27:17.080
I knew you couldn't bring yourself to do it.

27:18.790 --> 27:20.030
So I decided long ago

27:25.750 --> 27:28.280
that you wouldn't have to make a choice for me.

27:30.720 --> 27:32.550
This is my decision.

27:34.790 --> 27:36.750
I am willing to bear the guilt

27:37.110 --> 27:40.370
of killing my dearest friend for all the lifetimes to come.

27:43.510 --> 27:45.310
You don't need to bear it for me.

27:49.830 --> 27:50.640
Zhuo,

27:54.110 --> 27:55.440
you're still so...

28:07.200 --> 28:08.110
Zhao Yuanzhou.

28:11.240 --> 28:12.100
Zhao Yuanzhou.

28:31.270 --> 28:32.130
Zhao Yuanzhou!

30:21.350 --> 30:22.790
The poison in my body...

30:24.240 --> 30:25.960
I've absorbed it all.

30:29.200 --> 30:30.000
Don't worry.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.200
It's fine now.

30:41.480 --> 30:43.680
Am I amazing?

31:07.200 --> 31:08.510
I know you are sad.

31:09.270 --> 31:10.510
But life is short.

31:12.750 --> 31:14.480
Don't be sad for too long.

31:16.280 --> 31:18.940
I can't bear to see you spend the rest of your life

31:19.400 --> 31:21.310
grieving for me.

31:23.070 --> 31:24.070
Your tears

31:24.070 --> 31:26.330
should be used to save all living beings.

31:27.960 --> 31:29.510
Don't let them fall for me.

32:02.750 --> 32:04.590
You won't die so easily.

32:05.920 --> 32:07.920
You said you would always be with me.

32:11.070 --> 32:12.240
You lied to me.

32:16.270 --> 32:17.680
You liar.

32:58.750 --> 32:59.830
Meeting you all

33:01.720 --> 33:05.550
was like having a long, beautiful dream.

33:07.790 --> 33:09.590
But dreams always end,

33:11.880 --> 33:13.000
and it's time for me

33:13.830 --> 33:15.400
to leave now.

34:20.400 --> 34:21.260
Zhao Yuanzhou,

34:22.280 --> 34:23.630
I fulfilled my vow,

34:24.840 --> 34:25.840
but you didn't.

34:27.880 --> 34:28.960
You liar.

34:32.469 --> 34:33.760
The road ahead is long,

34:34.440 --> 34:36.440
filled with hardships and dangers.

34:38.070 --> 34:39.190
Mr. Zhuo,

34:41.000 --> 34:41.800
from now on,

34:42.550 --> 34:45.080
you will have to protect everyone on your own.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.630
Use my body

34:57.110 --> 35:00.040
to drive the powerful malicious energy in the world,

35:00.630 --> 35:03.360
turning the tears of the Baize Goddess into rain,

35:05.000 --> 35:06.260
falling on all things.

35:11.230 --> 35:12.030
This way,

35:13.670 --> 35:15.470
everyone will be saved.

35:16.760 --> 35:18.550
But your soul will dissipate

35:19.590 --> 35:20.840
and cease to exist.

35:24.960 --> 35:26.030
Your tears

35:27.030 --> 35:29.290
should be used to save all living beings.

35:30.360 --> 35:32.190
Don't let them fall for me.

35:40.480 --> 35:41.480
Dead demons

35:42.710 --> 35:44.550
will turn into stars in the sky.

35:47.110 --> 35:48.230
And what about you?

35:50.880 --> 35:52.230
I will turn into rain.

35:54.880 --> 35:55.880
From now on,

35:56.550 --> 35:58.360
whenever it rains,

36:01.190 --> 36:03.000
it will be me, staying by your side.
